{"id":"ccbc16:puzzle:9","answer":"战国策","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"我毫无头绪","html":"<p>每串黄色箭头指的四个字是一个成语。</p>","text":"每串黄色箭头指的四个字是一个成语。","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"text","html":"<p>根据左上角的提示，每组黄色箭头都指向一个成语，可以填完这个格子得到：</p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-8aeb60382b4c1bf2c7fb0e23\" src=\"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/660e44e73c2e4116947488f411f1f848.webp\"/></p>\n<p>提取三个角的红框字得到答案<code>战国策</code>。</p>","text":"根据左上角的提示，每组黄色箭头都指向一个成语，可以填完这个格子得到：\n\n提取三个角的红框字得到答案\n战国策\n。","refId":null,"assetIds":["asset-8aeb60382b4c1bf2c7fb0e23"]},"extended":{"html":"","text":"","assetIds":[]},"interactive":{"html":"<img src=\"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/3ab9513633fc426e9b7ee3d3fb920e17.webp\" class=\"pimg\">\n<style>\n.pimg {\n    width: 700px;\n}\n@media (max-width: 740px) {\n    .pimg {\n        width: 100%;\n    }\n}\n</style>"},"sourceMetadata":{"type":1,"answer_type":0,"extend_data":"{\"pid\":9,\"imgUrl\":\"6b1474f0a5f64cf9b5bca9011b0303ac.webp\",\"color\":\"#000\",\"top\":\"490px\",\"left\":\"452px\"}","pgid":1,"pg_name":"序章","resolved_extend_assets":["https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/6b1474f0a5f64cf9b5bca9011b0303ac.webp"]},"failedAssets":[],"assets":[{"id":"asset-77c1aacd4748eb85c22baf92","url":"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/6b1474f0a5f64cf9b5bca9011b0303ac.webp","path":"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/6b1474f0a5f64cf9b5bca9011b0303ac.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":7726,"sha256":"c016381f7b8ec52a2b98eb087aab2f0d4261e1c5419a3c7d33b0fb3770972a51","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["puzzle"],"contexts":["sourceMetadata"]},{"id":"asset-8aeb60382b4c1bf2c7fb0e23","url":"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/660e44e73c2e4116947488f411f1f848.webp","path":"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/660e44e73c2e4116947488f411f1f848.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":57584,"sha256":"64750d99d4789c98074c163583633bed232b835630d1f2ed